{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You enter a dark forest to search for your missing sister.</strong><br>But you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move deeper into the woods, you begin to realize that a mysterious cult is performing rituals in the shadows. They don\u2019t attack you directly \u2014 but their presence follows you everywhere. Watching. Waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>first-person psychological forest horror game</strong> focused on:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Tension instead of cheap jumpscares</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Feeling hunted without knowing when danger will strike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Getting lost in darkness with only a weak light to guide you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/69e0a91f0633721e0e38f31b15479e65.poster.avif?t=1767621383\" width=622 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/69e0a91f0633721e0e38f31b15479e65.webm?t=1767621383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/69e0a91f0633721e0e38f31b15479e65.mp4?t=1767621383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Explore a hostile forest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Follow the traces of your missing sister</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Hide, escape, and survive against unknown threats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Experience intense scripted horror moments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Horror Moments Include:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Suddenly finding yourself inside a cult ritual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Being chased by a massive bear in the deep forest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Discovering a cult member mourning beside a coffin in the darkness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not about killing.<br>This is about <strong>surviving fear itself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/0c3eebed25ffd7b00186f748fe81c15f.poster.avif?t=1767621383\" width=450 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/0c3eebed25ffd7b00186f748fe81c15f.webm?t=1767621383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130150?t=1767621383","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130150?t=1767621383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/1c82c24297a0fab9385f20b0d2d1c24fc0beefa5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767621383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/1c82c24297a0fab9385f20b0d2d1c24fc0beefa5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767621383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4219170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You enter a dark forest to search for your missing sister.</strong><br>But you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move deeper into the woods, you begin to realize that a mysterious cult is performing rituals in the shadows. They don\u2019t attack you directly \u2014 but their presence follows you everywhere. Wat